        13 * F.residueBits.eval κ +
      24
'TCSlib.Cryptography.Encryption.PublicKey.Regev.encryptAdvice_eq' depends on axioms: [propext, Quot.sound]
TCSlib.Cryptography.Encryption.PublicKey.Regev.encryptAdvice_eq : ∀ (P : TCSlib.Cryptography.LWE.Parameters) (w : ℕ)
